{
  "book": "1nephi",
  "bookName": "1 Nephi",
  "chapter": 10,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 340.111,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.362,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Nephi, proceed to give a account upon these plates of my proceedings, and my reign and ministry;",
      "verse": "10:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 6.542,
      "end": 8.864,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, to proceed with mine account,",
      "verse": "10:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 9.044,
      "end": 12.063,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I must speak somewhat of the things of my father,",
      "verse": "10:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 12.243,
      "end": 13.868,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also of my brethren.",
      "verse": "10:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 14.548,
      "end": 21.514,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, it came to pass after my father had made an end of speaking the words of his dream,",
      "verse": "10:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 21.694,
      "end": 24.62,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also of exhorting them to all diligence,",
      "verse": "10:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 24.8,
      "end": 27.215,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he spake unto them concerning the Jews\u2014",
      "verse": "10:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 27.895,
      "end": 29.938,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "That after they should be destroyed,",
      "verse": "10:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 30.118,
      "end": 32.44,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even that great city Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "10:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 32.62,
      "end": 38.332,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and many be carried away captive into Babylon, according to the own due time of the Lord,",
      "verse": "10:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 38.512,
      "end": 43.528,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they should return again, yea, even be brought back out of captivity;",
      "verse": "10:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 43.708,
      "end": 46.866,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and after they should be brought back out of captivity",
      "verse": "10:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 47.046,
      "end": 50.343,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they should possess again the land of their inheritance.",
      "verse": "10:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 51.023,
      "end": 55.295,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, even six hundred years from the time that my father left Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "10:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 55.475,
      "end": 58.494,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a prophet would the Lord God raise up among the Jews\u2014",
      "verse": "10:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 58.674,
      "end": 61.135,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even a Messiah, or, in other words,",
      "verse": "10:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 61.315,
      "end": 62.894,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a Savior of the world.",
      "verse": "10:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 63.574,
      "end": 66.082,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also spake concerning the prophets,",
      "verse": "10:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 66.262,
      "end": 69.466,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "how great a number had testified of these things,",
      "verse": "10:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 69.646,
      "end": 71.457,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning this Messiah,",
      "verse": "10:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 71.637,
      "end": 75.817,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of whom he had spoken, or this Redeemer of the world.",
      "verse": "10:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 76.497,
      "end": 80.444,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, all mankind were in a lost and in a fallen state,",
      "verse": "10:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 80.624,
      "end": 82.017,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ever would be",
      "verse": "10:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 82.197,
      "end": 84.844,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save they should rely on this Redeemer.",
      "verse": "10:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 85.524,
      "end": 89.657,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he spake also concerning a prophet who should come before the Messiah,",
      "verse": "10:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 89.837,
      "end": 91.88,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to prepare the way of the Lord\u2014",
      "verse": "10:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 92.56,
      "end": 95.532,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, even he should go forth and cry in the wilderness:",
      "verse": "10:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 95.712,
      "end": 97.709,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Prepare ye the way of the Lord,",
      "verse": "10:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 97.889,
      "end": 100.025,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and make his paths straight;",
      "verse": "10:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 100.205,
      "end": 103.502,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for there standeth one among you whom ye know not;",
      "verse": "10:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 103.682,
      "end": 105.493,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he is mightier than I,",
      "verse": "10:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 105.673,
      "end": 109.017,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whose shoe's latchet I am not worthy to unloose.",
      "verse": "10:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 109.197,
      "end": 112.076,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And much spake my father concerning this thing.",
      "verse": "10:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 112.756,
      "end": 116.564,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And my father said he should baptize in Bethabara, beyond Jordan;",
      "verse": "10:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 116.744,
      "end": 119.484,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he also said he should baptize with water;",
      "verse": "10:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 119.664,
      "end": 122.775,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even that he should baptize the Messiah with water.",
      "verse": "10:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 123.455,
      "end": 126.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after he had baptized the Messiah with water,",
      "verse": "10:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 126.421,
      "end": 128.789,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he should behold and bear record",
      "verse": "10:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 128.969,
      "end": 131.384,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he had baptized the Lamb of God,",
      "verse": "10:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 131.564,
      "end": 134.258,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who should take away the sins of the world.",
      "verse": "10:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 134.938,
      "end": 138.7,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass after my father had spoken these words",
      "verse": "10:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 138.88,
      "end": 142.038,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he spake unto my brethren concerning the gospel",
      "verse": "10:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 142.218,
      "end": 144.54,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which should be preached among the Jews,",
      "verse": "10:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 144.72,
      "end": 148.435,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also concerning the dwindling of the Jews in unbelief.",
      "verse": "10:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 148.615,
      "end": 150.983,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after they had slain the Messiah,",
      "verse": "10:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 151.163,
      "end": 152.556,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who should come,",
      "verse": "10:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 152.736,
      "end": 154.686,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and after he had been slain",
      "verse": "10:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 154.866,
      "end": 156.816,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he should rise from the dead,",
      "verse": "10:11",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 156.996,
      "end": 161.965,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and should make himself manifest, by the Holy Ghost, unto the Gentiles.",
      "verse": "10:11",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 162.645,
      "end": 165.942,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, even my father spake much concerning the Gentiles,",
      "verse": "10:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 166.122,
      "end": 168.908,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also concerning the house of Israel,",
      "verse": "10:12",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 169.088,
      "end": 172.525,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they should be compared like unto an olive tree,",
      "verse": "10:12",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 172.705,
      "end": 175.352,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whose branches should be broken off",
      "verse": "10:12",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 175.532,
      "end": 178.969,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and should be scattered upon all the face of the earth.",
      "verse": "10:12",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 179.649,
      "end": 190.98,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, he said it must needs be that we should be led with one accord into the land of promise, unto the fulfilling of the word of the Lord,",
      "verse": "10:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 191.16,
      "end": 194.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we should be scattered upon all the face of the earth.",
      "verse": "10:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 195.369,
      "end": 198.063,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after the house of Israel should be scattered",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 198.243,
      "end": 201.587,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they should be gathered together again; or, in fine,",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 201.767,
      "end": 205.482,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after the Gentiles had received the fulness of the Gospel,",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 205.662,
      "end": 210.91,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the natural branches of the olive tree, or the remnants of the house of Israel,",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 211.09,
      "end": 212.715,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should be grafted in,",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 212.895,
      "end": 215.542,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or come to the knowledge of the true Messiah,",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 215.722,
      "end": 217.858,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their Lord and their Redeemer.",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 218.538,
      "end": 220.721,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after this manner of language",
      "verse": "10:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 220.901,
      "end": 224.152,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "did my father prophesy and speak unto my brethren",
      "verse": "10:15",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 224.332,
      "end": 226.143,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also many more things",
      "verse": "10:15",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 226.323,
      "end": 228.645,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which I do not write in this book;",
      "verse": "10:15",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 228.825,
      "end": 234.212,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I have written as many of them as were expedient for me in mine other book.",
      "verse": "10:15",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 234.892,
      "end": 237.353,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And all these things, of which I have spoken,",
      "verse": "10:16",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 237.533,
      "end": 242.27,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "were done as my father dwelt in a tent, in the valley of Lemuel.",
      "verse": "10:16",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 242.95,
      "end": 248.058,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass after I, Nephi, having heard all the words of my father,",
      "verse": "10:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 248.238,
      "end": 251.396,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning the things which he saw in a vision,",
      "verse": "10:17",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 251.576,
      "end": 255.709,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also the things which he spake by the power of the Holy Ghost,",
      "verse": "10:17",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 255.889,
      "end": 259.047,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which power he received by faith on the Son of God\u2014",
      "verse": "10:17",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 259.227,
      "end": 262.292,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Son of God was the Messiah who should come\u2014",
      "verse": "10:17",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 262.472,
      "end": 264.701,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I, Nephi, was desirous also",
      "verse": "10:17",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 264.881,
      "end": 271.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might see, and hear, and know of these things, by the power of the Holy Ghost,",
      "verse": "10:17",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 271.33,
      "end": 276.113,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is the gift of God unto all those who diligently seek him,",
      "verse": "10:17",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 276.293,
      "end": 277.918,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as well in times of old",
      "verse": "10:17",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 278.098,
      "end": 283.253,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as in the time that he should manifest himself unto the children of men.",
      "verse": "10:17",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 283.933,
      "end": 287.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For he is the same yesterday, today, and forever;",
      "verse": "10:18",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 287.968,
      "end": 291.823,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the way is prepared for all men from the foundation of the world,",
      "verse": "10:18",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 292.003,
      "end": 295.068,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if it so be that they repent and come unto him.",
      "verse": "10:18",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 295.748,
      "end": 298.395,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For he that diligently seeketh shall find;",
      "verse": "10:19",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 298.575,
      "end": 303.591,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the mysteries of God shall be unfolded unto them, by the power of the Holy Ghost,",
      "verse": "10:19",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 303.771,
      "end": 306.186,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as well in these times as in times of old,",
      "verse": "10:19",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 306.366,
      "end": 309.385,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as well in times of old as in times to come;",
      "verse": "10:19",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 309.565,
      "end": 312.584,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, the course of the Lord is one eternal round.",
      "verse": "10:19",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 313.264,
      "end": 316.561,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore remember, O man, for all thy doings",
      "verse": "10:20",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 316.741,
      "end": 319.202,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thou shalt be brought into judgment.",
      "verse": "10:20",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 319.882,
      "end": 324.712,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, if ye have sought to do wickedly in the days of your probation,",
      "verse": "10:21",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 324.892,
      "end": 328.189,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then ye are found unclean before the judgment-seat of God;",
      "verse": "10:21",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 328.369,
      "end": 330.691,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and no unclean thing can dwell with God;",
      "verse": "10:21",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 330.871,
      "end": 333.332,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, ye must be cast off forever.",
      "verse": "10:21",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 334.012,
      "end": 336.38,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Holy Ghost giveth authority",
      "verse": "10:22",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 336.56,
      "end": 339.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I should speak these things, and deny them not.",
      "verse": "10:22",
      "lineIndex": 99
    }
  ]
}